 ScenezXR DU1.png", "id": "860114692631071", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974628_860114695964404_8521826312028011421_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XKB2-vHsC_4Q7kNvwHXpSbC&_nc_oc=AdmBeF7Vef-wcDCUW-0Nw8hiHb8vJXHaM5ATF58FUSP4hHdi7Hl3E1WlspTyHkvNzq0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuD3Y5Tb3qQu3XBGwvqsXlz5P0zpCPw-Zd4ucVa2AXQGQ&oe=6999C2C5"}, {"file_name": "MetaScreenShot ScenezXR Mica1.png", "id": "1493385884904887", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974469_1493385888238220_5074879560501904780_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RYNnSIGC1u8Q7kNvwGNejMZ&_nc_oc=AdnLr9nC6uhkQgBJ4km7rZWALc8uUEeuAA3eJSf9gQH7qI5GnvsgnemIRo263LQ7D5o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftkmfeRQcvkq5ADZYSswl_OfI_Z2qFCGEVFjZa0mjcZVw&oe=6999AD46"}, {"file_name": "MetaScreenShot ScenezXR JM.png", "id": "1151098436114581", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974886_1151098439447914_4249611160335607262_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yrnulya_jZUQ7kNvwGo6_m0&_nc_oc=Adlwxht8HxCz-y6rA7-NQYuh4zdFQ1wagKrb6c8u5vk3fkiV63e0uwhaOfOiK5It6V8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvKviLPt3K_lnX-esYYtpSe8LwDGgTGXG9SjXjvYlUvcA&oe=6999BBC1"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "MetaCoverimage ScenezXR.png", "id": "1147384969808452", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974802_1147384973141785_3689711553277891187_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OtK-8GPcei4Q7kNvwGLhayl&_nc_oc=Adldm3z2NlLHuqdGCimoUVEImPuZHEni8fOlEOIaaFOWqqhTkz_vODtMy3ToRmL5mv4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvnXf7t1BSBkYbt6_raHXhbEwanpKdg2wJI5R13Dk9o_w&oe=6999BBF2"}, "display_name": "Scenez XR", "keywords": ["music", "entertainment", "comedy", "4d"], "long_description": "Step into a new dimension of entertainment with Scenez XR, exclusively on Meta Quest 3. Dive into an unpa